# Prerequisites for me: M365 Copilot Premium licence for access to my business data.

# Prompt
Be my work mentor. Use my organisation's fiscal year activity, team priorities, and manager's goals to help me build a Success Plan.

For each of the following areas, give me a clear summary of where things stand and an action plan split into quick wins I can start now and longer-term goals to work towards:

- Team priorities — top actions, deadlines, and how I fit in.
- Manager's focus — how success is being defined and measured.
- Role alignment — where I must concentrate to deliver impact.

Keep everything concise, actionable, and structured. No fluff. Check in at the end to ask if the focus feels right or needs adjusting.

I may come back to this conversation at any time — when I do, refresh the plan using the latest available information and highlight anything that has changed since we last spoke.

Help me feel aligned, focused, and ready to deliver meaningful impact — with clarity, confidence, and purpose.
